ught  over 850 million u.s. dollars in that  box offices worldwide Sony more or less  surprisingly announced a second part a  few days ago part of venom 2 will be  again Tom Hardy Michelle Williams and  Woody Harrelson among others who were  already highly acclaimed in the first  part we don't know yet who will be  allowed to sit in the director's chair  further it is certain that ruben  fleischer has expressed great interest  but is probably still busy with his  other project Zombieland - it is also  unclear when venom 2 will be shown in  the cinemas but it seems almost certain  that we will see the antihero on screen  by the end of 2020 as Sony announced to  spider-man spin-offs for next year what  many fans are still very interested in  is whether or not the popular spider-man  will be seen in the venom movie however  even screenwriter Jeff Pinkner still  keeps us waiting  because only recently he announced that  spider-man could play a significant role  in the upcoming venom movie  [Music]
 

